# Android signing key. Losing it means never being able to update the app;
# committing it means anyone can publish as you. Back it up outside the repo.
apps/mobile/credentials/

# Built APKs. The signed release APK in build-output/ is committed as the
# distributable artefact, on request — note that each build adds ~60 MB to the
# repo permanently, since git history keeps every version. GitHub Releases is
# the usual home for this if the repo gets heavy.
# The `android/` entry above stays ignored: that is generated prebuild
# scaffolding, not an artefact.
!build-output/
